<title>GERMANY: Hugo Boss H1 after-tax profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Hugo Boss H1 after-tax profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>METZINGEN, Germany 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit		   38.5    up 25 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  529.7   up 17 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German fashion retailer is Hugo Boss AG, a unit of Italian textile group Marzotto.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
